  "prefLabel": "Rev 2601.08 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2601.08 “Person” means any:\n\n(a) Individual;\n\n(b) Corporation;\n\n(c) Partnership;\n\n(d) Trust;\n\n(e) Estate;\n\n(f) Limited liability company;\n\n(g) Association;\n\n(h) Joint venture;\n\n(i) Non-profit organization;\n\n(j) Receiver, trustee, guardian, or other representative appointed by order of any court; or\n\n(k) Governmental unit.\n\nSource. #7479, eff 4-24-01; ss by #9443, eff 4-1-09; ss by #12138, eff 3-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2600.html"
